# Switches the mode of the running mission, e.g. PATROL / HOME / STOP. The
# mission lists its modes in the 'modes' parameter, and its tree reads the
# current one from the blackboard entry 'mode' (e.g. with a Switch node).

# One of the mission's 'modes', in any case (stop, STOP, Stop, ...).
string mode
---
bool success
string message
